 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 534363,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the measurements of each angle in the given figure.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/800006f590891ac6.png\" alt=\"A four-sided polygon. The interior angles measure 152 degrees, (5 x plus 1) degrees, (x plus 12) degrees, and (9 x) degrees.\">\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Find the sum of the interior angles. This is a quadrilateral, so <span data-math=\"n = 4\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The sum of the interior angles of a polygon with <i>n</i> sides is <span data-math=\"S = \\left( {n - 2} \\right)180^\\circ \"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"S = \\left( {n - 2} \\right)180^\\circ = \\left( {4 - 2} \\right)180^\\circ = \\left( 2 \\right)180^\\circ = 360^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Add up the angles and set it equal to the sum of the angles. Then solve for the unknowns.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"152 + \\left( {5x + 1} \\right) + \\left( {x + 12} \\right) + \\left( {9x} \\right) = 360\"></span></td>\n<td>Combine like terms.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"15x + 165 = 360\"></span></td>\n<td>Subtract.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"15x = 195\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = 13\"></span></td>\n<td>Evaluate the expressions for each angle.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"5x + 1 = 5\\left( {13} \\right) + 1 = 65 + 1 = 66^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"9x = 9\\left( {13} \\right) = 117^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x + 12 = 13 + 12 = 25^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p>The interior angles measure 66°, 117°, and 25°.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{*{20}{rcl}}{360}&amp;{=}&amp;{152 + 9x + (5x + 1) + (x + 12)}\\\\{}&amp;{=}&amp;{15x + 165}\\\\{195}&amp;{=}&amp;{15x}\\\\{13}&amp;{=}&amp;{x}\\\\{x + 12}&amp;{=}&amp;{25^ \\circ },\\,9x = {117^ \\circ },\\,5x + 1 = {66^ \\circ }\\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}{360}&amp;{=}&amp;{152 + 9x + (5x + 1) + (x + 12)}\\\\{}&amp;{=}&amp;{15x + 165}\\\\{195}&amp;{=}&amp;{15x}\\\\{13}&amp;{=}&amp;{x}\\\\{x + 12}&amp;{=}&amp;{25^ \\circ },\\,9x = {117^ \\circ },\\,5x + 1 = {66^ \\circ }\\end{array}</span>"
    }
   ],
